2. Why you chsoe assets?


The assets used within the website prototype were carefully chosen to create a 
professional, attractive, and user-friendly design that would appeal to the 
target audience. A simple and clear font style was selected because it is easy
to read on different devices and helps users quickly understand the information 
presented on the website. Using a normal, clean font also improves accessibility 
and keeps the design looking professional rather than overcrowded or difficult to read. 
The main colour chosen for the website was green because it links well with the farming 
theme and helps create a calm, natural, and welcoming appearance for users. Green is commonly
associated with nature, growth, freshness, and the environment, making it highly suitable 
for the purpose of the website. The colour scheme also helps important sections and buttons 
stand out while still maintaining a relaxing and visually appealing design.

Images were included throughout the website, including logos and background images,
to make the website more visually engaging and professional. The logo helps create a 
recognisable brand identity, allowing users to remember the website more easily and 
giving the business a more trustworthy appearance. Background images related to farming 
and agriculture were used to support the overall theme of the website and make the pages 
look less plain while improving the visual experience for users. These images also help 
users immediately understand the purpose of the website when they first visit it.

The text used on the website was intentionally kept short, clear, 
and direct so customers do not become bored or overwhelmed when reading
large amounts of information. Only the most important information was 
included to ensure users can quickly find what they need without unnecessary 
distractions. Keeping the content simple improves the user experience because 
customers are more likely to stay engaged and continue using the website if 
information is easy to understand and accessible. Important data only was requested 
from users during account creation and forms to avoid making the process too long or 
frustrating, which helps reduce annoyance and encourages users to complete actions on the website.

The layout of the website was designed to be simple and easy to navigate so users can
move between pages quickly and efficiently. Clear menus, organised sections, and visible 
buttons help users locate information without confusion. This improves usability and ensures
that users of different ages and technical abilities can use the website comfortably. 
Overall, the chosen assets work together to create a visually appealing, functional, 
and professional website that provides a positive experience for users while supporting 
the farming theme effectively.
